{"id":"9fc0a120866a80f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-cor-chain-condition-cardinal.md","title":"Chain Condition Cardinal Preservation","display":"cor-chain-condition-cardinal — Chain Condition Cardinal Preservation","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-chain-condition-cardinal","aliases":["58-cor-chain-condition-cardinal"],"display":"cor-chain-condition-cardinal — Chain Condition Cardinal Preservation","depends_on":["[[58-df-chain-condition]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-chain-condition-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-chain-condition-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-chain-condition-cardinal — Chain Condition Cardinal Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"58-df-chain-condition\">58-df-chain-condition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ffb6ae6f4ef2728\" href=\"?note=9ffb6ae6f4ef2728\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\theta,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\theta,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, theory, coded forcing, carrier, order, and cardinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span> (a countable transitive ZFC ground)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\theta}(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\theta}(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (chain-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"58-df-chain-condition\">58-df-chain-condition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\\)</span> (five-place model-relative preservation predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}chain-condition-cardinal}\\vdash\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land P,\\leq_P,\\theta\\in M\\land M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CC}_{v_0}(v_1)\\urcorner[\\theta,\\mathbb P]\\to\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}chain-condition-cardinal}\\vdash\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land P,\\leq_P,\\theta\\in M\\land M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CC}_{v_0}(v_1)\\urcorner[\\theta,\\mathbb P]\\to\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}cardinals\\text{-}above}\\vdash\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,\\leq_P,\\theta\\in M\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in M\\;\\Bigl(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\lambda]\\land\\theta\\leq\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\lambda)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}cardinals\\text{-}above}\\vdash\\mathrm{PreservesCardinals}_{\\geq\\theta,S}(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,\\leq_P,\\theta\\in M\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in M\\;\\Bigl(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\lambda]\\land\\theta\\leq\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\lambda)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Internally, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>-c.c. forcing preserves ground-model cardinals at and above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>; cardinality and chain condition are evaluated in the transitive ground.</li>\n<li>The result is expressed through the registered preservation predicate rather than a forcing symbol missing its model, order, condition, formula code, and name parameters.</li>\n<li>This is fundamental for forcing arguments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-chain-condition","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain-condition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"9ffb6ae6f4ef2728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain-condition","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CC}_{\\theta}(\\mathbb P)$ (chain-condition predicate, see [[58-df-chain-condition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\theta,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","dis